  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_3_bbde" name="Here are a few options for the transition sentence:&#10;&#10;**Option 1 (Focus on the prototype):**&#10;&quot;Once the Lego machine prototype is successfully assembled and tested through Process A, it serves as a tangible proof-of-concept, triggering the formal product development cycle outlined in Process B.&quot;&#10;&#10;**Option 2 (Focus on the outcome):**&#10;&quot;The successful completion of the functional Lego prototype in Process A demonstrates the initial feasibility of the machine concept, initiating the structured research, development, and refinement stages described in Process B.&quot;" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_3" sourceRef="atom_2_ManualTask_5" targetRef="Bridge_3_bbde" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_3" sourceRef="Bridge_3_bbde" targetRef="atom_3_Task_2" /><bpmn:extensionElements />
