      <bpmn:task id="Bridge_4_e982" name="Here are a few options for the transition sentence:&#10;&#10;**Option 1 (Direct Trigger):**&#10;&gt; Once the prototype is approved for further development, the product becomes available for sale, initiating the Order to Cash process when a customer places an order.&#10;&#10;**Option 2 (Focus on Outcome):**&#10;&gt; The approval of the prototype signifies that the product is ready for production and sale, meaning the next step is fulfilling customer orders via the Order to Cash process.&#10;&#10;**Option 3 (Concise):**&#10;&gt; Following prototype approval, the product moves into the operational phase, starting with the Order to Cash process triggered by customer orders." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_4" sourceRef="atom_3_ExclusiveGateway_2" targetRef="Bridge_4_e982" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_4" sourceRef="Bridge_4_e982" targetRef="atom_4_sid-DAC9E37C-C386-4072-A774-4D75FA666250" /><bpmn:userTask id="atom_5_UserTask_1" name="Check desired airplane type">
