  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_5_11a4" name="Here are a few options for the transition sentence:&#10;&#10;**Option 1 (Focus on Sale):**&#10;&gt; Once the product is sold to the customer in Process A, the customization and manufacturing details outlined in the Luxury Airplane process (Process B) are triggered based on the customer's specific order requirements.&#10;&#10;**Option 2 (Focus on Handoff):**&#10;&gt; The completion of Process A, resulting in a confirmed sale, initiates Process B where the customer's specific customization choices for their luxury airplane are implemented.&#10;&#10;**Option 3 (More Direct):**&#10;&gt; After the product is sold to the customer (Process A), the manufacturing and customization process detailed in Process B begins, translating the customer's specifications into the final airplane." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_5" sourceRef="atom_4_sid-8B760422-D6BF-4BDB-AAE6-3236668A3FC6" targetRef="Bridge_5_11a4" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_5" sourceRef="Bridge_5_11a4" targetRef="atom_5_UserTask_1" /><bpmn:userTask id="atom_6_UserTask_1" name="Send sketches to an artist">
